{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>מכרם</b> Three times in the Masorah: ואם מימיך נשתה ונתתי מכרם; ואעיד ביום מכרם ציד; על מכרם בכסף צדיק. Because they sold for righteous silver and hunted their father on the day of their sale with their mouths and said to him, 'A wild beast has devoured him' — therefore, ונתתי מכרם, and they were forced to drink their water for silver."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:40.264382835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}